00:09:35.337 --> 00:09:36.890
"that's not happening to you."

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.430
Like yes,

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.670
yes it is.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.820
It was always a craziest reaction.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:45.480
So I either got white women apologizing

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.357
or white men saying to me,

00:09:47.357 --> 00:09:48.500
"this didn't happen."

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.756
So I was like,

00:09:49.756 --> 00:09:51.956
"okay, I have to put
this joke in this set."

00:09:54.257 --> 00:09:55.846
(audience applauds)

00:09:55.846 --> 00:09:56.679
Thank you.

00:09:56.679 --> 00:09:57.512
That's hilarious.

00:09:57.512 --> 00:09:58.345
Thank you.

00:09:58.345 --> 00:09:59.178
Thank you so much.

00:09:59.178 --> 00:10:01.080
That's Sloan, ladies and gentlemen,

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.080
He was saying how funny I was

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.473
and he was just like,
"if you need anything,

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:07.280
you know, let us know

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.070
if you ever wanna come back on the show,

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.160
let us know."

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:10.993
And I was like,

00:10:10.993 --> 00:10:12.440
"he didn't have to say that."

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.790
So, I knew, it was g...

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:14.890
He was, he was just telling me,

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:15.723
he like,

00:10:15.723 --> 00:10:16.556
"you're so funny.

00:10:16.556 --> 00:10:18.120
And I really enjoyed watching you."

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:18.953
And I was like,

00:10:18.953 --> 00:10:19.786
"Oh man."

00:10:19.786 --> 00:10:21.350
Like I just,

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.450
I didn't expect him to say all that stuff.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.075
So when I walked off stage, I was like,

00:10:28.075 --> 00:10:29.410
I just didn't cry.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.620
And like that's when I
let everything hit me.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.520
That's when everybody
got to know who I was,

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.680
I've done two pilots.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:37.070
I've had, I just,

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.870
I'm doing a movie that...

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.250
I just did a movie this year

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.420
and it's coming out in November.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.420
Conan was kind of the
springboard for everything.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.850
So I'm so thankful to y'all

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.803
for just being supportive of me.

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:51.050
It's a small little like
calling card for you.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:54.290
But I just knew that
this was like starting

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.380
an unstoppable force

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.990
and I'm so happy just
to see what you've done.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.560
I should have been fired
if I didn't book you.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.055
That's all I could say.

00:11:02.055 --> 00:11:02.888
Oh, thank you.

00:11:02.888 --> 00:11:04.030
It was the easiest,

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.800
like the easiest decision
when Reggie emailed me,

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:06.948
I was like,

00:11:06.948 --> 00:11:08.566
"Oh yeah. Okay, let's do this."

00:11:08.566 --> 00:11:09.899
Oh, thank you.

